# Base URL of the Gatebook backend (no trailing slash), read at build time by react-native-config.
# Leave empty to use the defaults: http://10.0.2.2:4000 on the Android emulator, http://localhost:4000 on the iOS simulator.
# On a physical phone use your computer's LAN IP, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:4000 (same Wi-Fi).
